<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>This macro will control the F2 recoil in Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six Siege.

Game settings:
800 dpi
12 horizontal sensitivity
12 verticle sensitive 
1920x1080
16:10 aspect ratio
84 FOV
50 ads

